TASK B27
	TITLE "brigade serve and the JSON API"
	STATUS draft
	MILESTONE @MILESTONE.M3
	COMPONENT "dashboard"
	ROLE ada
	SPEC "a loopback server"
	SPEC "the server binds 127.0.0.1 only, never 0.0.0.0 nor an address of the machine"
	SPEC "a request whose Host header is not the loopback host and port the server listens on is"
		+ "refused with 400 before any routing: a page reaching the port by DNS rebinding gets"
		+ "nothing"
	SPEC "a GET request changes no state of brigade; a state-changing request is a POST"
	SPEC "every string read from the corpus, the ledger, a run or a report is escaped on render; no"
		+ "content becomes HTML, markup written by an agent included"
	SPEC "no response carries a CORS header, whatever the Origin of the request"
	SPEC "/api/status, /api/waves/<id>, /api/inbox, /api/corpus, /api/ledger, /api/reports"
	SPEC "a polling page shell with theme tokens"
	SPEC "every state-changing POST of the server carries the token the server generated at its"
		+ "start and an Origin header equal to the loopback origin, the rule of SPEC 5 of"
		+ "@TASK.B28; a request missing either is refused with 403 and changes nothing"
		REF @TASK.B28
	AFTER @TASK.B05
	AFTER @TASK.B08
	SOURCE "use-case map of 2026-10-16, finding C19"

