		+ "runner"
		IMPL "tests/unit/scripted_processes.py::raise AssertionError(f\"no answer is scripted for"
	SPEC "tests/cli prove collect, a cache hit, --refresh, a failing collector left out of the"
		+ "cache, a collector declaring nothing never cached, collectors list over the four"
