TASK B48
	TITLE "STUDY entity and its answer entity, brigade study new, run, context and answer, study.md"
		+ "and the collectors shell and study"
	STATUS archived
	DESC "archived on 2026-10-24: @TASK.B22 makes false its SPEC that study new and study run"
		+ "refuse the output inbox; the inbox has its store, and a study whose output is inbox"
		+ "records its answer as a signal"
	MILESTONE @MILESTONE.M1
	COMPONENT "studies"
	ROLE ada
	SPEC "the STUDY schema of brigade/corpus/data/schema.awawa.tpl replaces TEMPLATE by ANSWER, the"
		+ "name of an entity type of the same schema, ANSWER by default; SCHEMA ANSWER declares"
		+ "STUDY, RUN, COLLECTED, one per collector holding its name, its summary and the path of"
		+ "its full document, which the CLI fills, and NARRATIVE and FINDING, repeatable, which the"
		+ "slot fills; brigade init installs it in a new operational corpus and upgrades no"
		+ "installed schema, an operational corpus of an older schema being thrown away"
		IMPL "brigade/corpus/data/schema.awawa.tpl::SCHEMA ANSWER"
		IMPL "brigade/corpus/data/schema.awawa.tpl::FIELD ANSWER string"
		IMPL "tests/cli/test_study.py::def"
			+ "test_should_record_an_answer_the_schema_of_its_type_accepts(self):"
		IMPL "tests/unit/studies/test_require_answer_type.py::def"
			+ "test_should_refuse_a_type_the_schema_does_not_declare(self):"
	SPEC "study new records a STUDY entity through fmt, lint and a commit, with the question"
		+ "verbatim, the project when there is one, the collectors, the slot or none, the schedule"
		+ "or none, the output and the type of the answer, and runs it once unless --every is given"
		IMPL "brigade/studies/record_study.py::def record_study(runtime: Runtime, study: NewStudy)"
			+ "-> None:"
