		IMPL "tests/unit/studies/test_write_answer.py::def"
			+ "test_should_append_the_answer_brigade_rendered_to_the_entities_of_its_type(self):"
		IMPL "tests/cli/test_study.py::def"
			+ "test_should_park_the_study_whose_judging_run_gave_no_answer(self):"
	SPEC "each step's result is a file under runs/<id>/steps/; study run records order.started,"
		+ "step.done, step.failed, order.parked and order.done with kind study; a failed step parks"
		+ "the study with the step's reason, and the next study run of it resumes that run at its"
		+ "first undone step; this layout and these events are the recipe engine's contract, which"
		+ "replaces this orchestration in M8 without a command changing"
