		IMPL "tests/unit/studies/test_build_study_context.py::def"
			+ "test_should_keep_the_package_in_the_run(self):"
	SPEC "study answer --file validates the answer by awawa lint against the schema of its type,"
		+ "never by a comparison of headings, refuses an answer that changed a field the CLI"
