	SPEC "the report is a dated file, docs/<YYYY-MM-DD>-foundations-review.md, delivered by a pull"
		+ "request of its own that changes no code and, in the corpus, only B61"
		IMPL "docs/2026-10-07-foundations-review.md::# Foundations review of brigade, M0, at main"
			+ "30a7331 (2026-10-07)"
	SPEC "the report names the commit of main it read; the repository at that commit is checked"
		+ "against each section of the plan, artifact/blueprint/parts/plan.html as brought in line"
		+ "with the decisions, and against every active DECISION of corpus/decisions.awawa; each"
		+ "departure names the file and the function or the line, and the plan section or the"
		+ "decision it departs from"
		IMPL "docs/2026-10-07-foundations-review.md::## Departures from the plan and the decisions"
	SPEC "each risk the foundations carry for a later milestone, M1 to M8, or for the goal of the"
		+ "tool, the CLI doing the mechanical work and waves running unattended on one machine"
		+ "across every registered project, names its evidence, a file, a command with its output"
		+ "or a decision, and the milestone it threatens, or the goal when no single milestone is"
		+ "threatened"
		IMPL "docs/2026-10-07-foundations-review.md::## Risks for the milestones and for the goal"
	SPEC "the report grades the whole repository on a scale it states, each grade carrying the"
		+ "evidence it rests on: each subpackage of brigade/, adapters, commands, corpus, git,"
		+ "ledger, registry, roles, runs, system and tick; the top-level modules of brigade/; each"
		+ "suite of tests/, cli, guards, integration and unit; build.py with bin/; .github/; the"
		+ "corpus of corpus/; and the documents AGENTS.md, README.md, HANDOFF.md and artifact/; no"
		+ "file tracked at the commit read falls outside a graded part"
		IMPL "docs/2026-10-07-foundations-review.md::## Grades"
	SPEC "each finding names what it becomes once the user has ruled: a draft TASK, an"
		+ "OPEN_QUESTION or an amendment of a DECISION; the review's pull request fixes nothing it"
		+ "found"
		IMPL "docs/2026-10-07-foundations-review.md::## What each finding becomes once ruled"
	SPEC "the report opens on its verdict, then the table of grades; one fact per line, each figure"
		+ "with its perimeter and the command that produced it"
		IMPL "docs/2026-10-07-foundations-review.md::The foundations hold:"
	SPEC "the report judges how easily the base takes maintenance and new features, and says"
		+ "whether brigade can start delivering its own waves, what is missing before the first"
		+ "one, and whether the switch comes before, at or after M2"
		IMPL "docs/2026-10-07-foundations-review.md::## Evolvability"
		IMPL "docs/2026-10-07-foundations-review.md::## Dogfooding: can brigade start delivering"
			+ "brigade"
	SPEC "the report is also a page of the Artifact, artifact/blueprint/parts/review.html behind a"
		+ "Review tab of artifact/blueprint/index.html, and the Artifact is republished with it"
