		+ "of the paths before the built-in modules, as _resolve_client does for"
		+ "brigade-client-<name>"
	SPEC "an executable forge or scheduler answers the kind's operations as JSON documents on stdin"
		+ "and stdout through the same caller as a client executable, validated on entry"
	SPEC "a unit test per kind proves the resolution with a fake executable on a temporary PATH,"
		+ "and a name matching no executable and no module raises the error naming both"
	AFTER @TASK.B73
	AFTER @TASK.B74
	AFTER @TASK.B75
