		+ "from the built-in modules alone, and _resolve_client, lines 57-70, gives the PATH search"
		+ "to the client kind only; DESC 1 of"
		+ "@DECISION.PluginsAreReachedByNameThroughOneResolverAndNeverImported reads \"a built-in"
		+ "plugin is a module under its kind's package, an external one an executable"
		+ "brigade-<kind>-<name> on PATH\"; plan section 11 line 524; @TASK.B46, M7, is the first"
		+ "to need it"
		REF @DECISION.PluginsAreReachedByNameThroughOneResolverAndNeverImported
		REF @TASK.B46
	RATIONALE "moved from F0 to ADD0 at its refinement: without it brigade uses its built-in forge,"
		+ "github, and its built-in schedulers, systemd, cron and loop, and no task of the MVP"
		+ "needs another; DESC 1 of the decision now states that forge and scheduler resolve their"
		+ "built-in modules alone until this task, which closes F7 within F0"
		REF @DECISION.PluginsAreReachedByNameThroughOneResolverAndNeverImported
	RATIONALE "the contract of an executable forge or scheduler is left to the refinement of this"
		+ "task: a client module answers every operation through answer(operation, request) and"
