		REF @TASK.B114
		REF @TASK.B138
	MILESTONE @MILESTONE.F0
	COMPONENT "runs"
	ROLE ada
	SPEC "during each segment the run appends to runs/<id>/journal.jsonl one JSON record per action"
		+ "of its client, carrying schema_version, the time brigade read it, the segment number,"
		+ "the kind of the action and a summary of 200 characters at most with a flag naming a cut;"
		+ "the new output of stdout.log is read every journal_poll_s seconds and once more when the"
		+ "segment ends, so that tail -f of the file shows an action at most journal_poll_s seconds"
		+ "after the client wrote it; the wall-time limit of the segment holds as today"
