			+ "test_should_journal_raw_records_of_an_output_whose_actions_the_client_fails_to_read(self):"
		IMPL "tests/cli/test_runs.py::class BrigadeRunJournalOfADetachedRunTest(RunsTestCase):"
	SPEC "journal_poll_s of config.toml is a positive number of seconds, 2 by default; any other"
		+ "value keeps the default and is a finding of brigade doctor naming the key and the file"
		IMPL "brigade/system/read_journal_poll.py::def read_journal_poll(document: dict, path:"
			+ "Path) -> tuple[int | float, tuple[str, ...]]:"
		IMPL "brigade/corpus/data/config.toml.tpl::# journal_poll_s = 2"
		IMPL "tests/unit/system/test_parse_configuration.py::class"
			+ "ReadConfigurationOfTheJournalPollTest(ReadConfigurationTestCase):"
		IMPL "tests/cli/test_doctor.py::def"
			+ "test_should_report_a_finding_naming_a_journal_poll_that_is_no_positive_number(self):"
	SPEC "the actions are read through an operation actions of the client adapter, declared in its"
