		+ "the launch-argv answer carries the session_id the client will use, null when the client"
		+ "takes none at launch; the Claude Code adapter passes it as --session-id and answers it,"
		+ "the fake adapter answers it unchanged; resume-argv never carries --session-id; the"
		+ "session of the run.finished line of a segment that exits is the session_id its"
		+ "parse-result answer reports, that of the launch-argv answer when it reports none, null"
		+ "naming its reason in nulls when neither names one; the session of a segment cut at the"
		+ "wall-time limit is the session_id of the launch-argv answer, a null one naming its"
		+ "reason in nulls"
