		+ "a  procedure on the remediate and review slots; the capabilities of each slot are proven"
		+ "in  tests/unit/runs/test_plan_run.py"
	MILESTONE @MILESTONE.F0
	COMPONENT "roles"
	ROLE ada
	SPEC "brigade/roles/data/reviewer.md, slot review, works as one read-only pass on a pull"
		+ "request it did not write: a verdict per acceptance criterion of its task with the"
		+ "command or the line that proves it, then the defects, untested paths and departures from"
		+ "the conventions the project states, graded, each with its file, line and reason;"
		+ "capabilities read and shell; brigade/roles/data/verifier.md is removed"
		IMPL "brigade/roles/data/reviewer.md::work: verifies and reviews a pull request it did not"
			+ "write"
	SPEC "brigade/roles/data/remediator.md, named remediator, slot remediate, reasoning standard,"
		+ "capabilities read, write and shell, answers the review of a pull request it did not"
		+ "review: each thread fixed or challenged with its reason, the branch put on its base and"
		+ "pushed; it returns the threads answered, the commits pushed and the state of the checks"
		IMPL "brigade/roles/data/remediator.md::slot: remediate"
	SPEC "the slots are plan, build, review, remediate, rebase, report, triage, rules and explore"
		+ "in brigade/system/read_configuration.py, the comments of"
		+ "brigade/corpus/data/config.toml.tpl, the example of brigade/corpus/data/schema.awawa.tpl"
		+ "and the Roles section of the README; brigade roles list shows these nine and no verify,"
		+ "and brigade roles lint stays green"
		IMPL "brigade/system/parse_configuration.py::SLOTS = (\"plan\", \"build\", \"review\","
			+ "\"remediate\","
		IMPL "tests/cli/test_roles.py::\"remediate  remediator  built-in  opus\","
	SPEC "tests/cli/test_run.py writes a procedure file declaring the capabilities read, write and"
		+ "shell and runs it on the fake client: with --slot remediate, run.json holds the slot"
		+ "remediate, the role remediator, the role source built-in and the capabilities read,"
		+ "write and shell; with --slot review, the capabilities read and shell"
		IMPL "tests/unit/runs/test_plan_run.py::def"
			+ "test_should_hold_the_capabilities_of_the_procedure_to_those_the_role_of_its_slot_allows(self):"
	RATIONALE "found while launching the review round of pull request #56 on 2026-10-07, run"
		+ "20261007T142949Z-327ab0: the review slot binds the built-in reviewer, read-only, whose"
		+ "work reads \"reviews a pull request\", so the procedure awawa-pr-review-round, which"
		+ "addresses the threads, writes the corpus and pushes, was launched on the build slot"
	RATIONALE "read at 2ec048c: brigade/runs/plan_run.py:152 keeps the capabilities of the"
