		+ "brigade ships no procedure, so the test writes its own"
	RATIONALE "the user ruled on 2026-10-10 the slots of @DECISION.RolesAreSlotsBoundToRoleFiles,"
		+ "amended in place: verify merges into review, which verifies and reviews in one pass, and"
		+ "remediate answers the review; @TASK.B16 gives its verdict on the review slot and"
