		+ "prints"
		IMPL "tests/awawa/test_recordings.py::def"
			+ "test_should_answer_every_recorded_call_as_it_was_recorded(self):"
		IMPL "tests/awawa/replay_recording.py::def replay_recording(test_case: unittest.TestCase,"
			+ "recording: dict, search_path: str) -> dict:"
	SPEC "the logs of the test jobs of the matrix of .github/workflows/ci.yml show no test skipped"
		+ "for want of awawa, and ci.yml installs no awawa and runs no awawa command"
