	COMPONENT "runs"
	ROLE ada
	SPEC "a segment whose main steps, counted as run.finished counts them, exceed the budget of its"
		+ "procedure appends a signal.recorded event whose signal is budget_exceeded, carrying"
		+ "steps and budget, whatever the client's error class, beside budget_reached when the"
