TASK B107
	TITLE "A role file and a procedure file are accepted in an awawa form through the document"
		+ "kind, the hand-written front-matter parser kept for the Markdown form alone"
	STATUS draft
	MILESTONE @MILESTONE.ADD0
	COMPONENT "roles"
	ROLE ada
	DESC "to settle in the refinement: whether the built-in roles of brigade/roles/data/ convert to"
		+ "the awawa form under a name not ending in .awawa, as DESC 2 of"
		+ "@DECISION.ShippedFilesLiveInsideThePackageAndAreReadAsResources requires of a shipped"
		+ "awawa file, or stay Markdown; the names of the entity types, ROLE and PROCEDURE; whether"
		+ "a file holds one entity or a directory of roles holds one corpus; how brigade roles lint"
		+ "reports a finding of awawa lint"
		REF @DECISION.ShippedFilesLiveInsideThePackageAndAreReadAsResources
	SPEC "a role file of the machine's roles/, of a ROLESET directory and among the built-in roles"
		+ "is accepted in an awawa form beside its Markdown form: one entity whose fields are name,"
		+ "slot, work, reasoning, capabilities, budget and returns, as the AGENT schema of the"
		+ "instructions corpus declares WORK, REASONING, CAPABILITY, BUDGET and RETURNS, and whose"
		+ "body is the rendering of the entity, as brigade/roles/resolve_role.py:108-124 fills the"
		+ "front matter of an AGENT entity through awawa --json and its body through awawa context"
	SPEC "a procedure file, shipped by brigade or in procedures/ of the instructions corpus, is"
		+ "accepted in the same way: one entity declaring capabilities and budget, the body the"
		+ "agent runs rendered from it"
	SPEC "both forms are read through the document kind of @TASK.B106, the plugin named by the"
		+ "extension, .md for the markdown plugin and .awawa for the awawa plugin;"
		+ "brigade/roles/parse_role_file.py, brigade/roles/check_front_matter.py and the key"
		+ "reading of brigade/runs/resolve_procedure.py:89-106 serve the Markdown form alone, and"
		+ "the awawa form is checked by awawa lint against the schema brigade ships, never by those"
		+ "parsers"
		REF @TASK.B106
	SPEC "brigade ships its own ROLE and PROCEDURE schema as a resource of its package under a name"
		+ "not ending in .awawa, as @DECISION.ShippedFilesLiveInsideThePackageAndAreReadAsResources"
		+ "sets, and opens no file of the author's instructions corpus: the PROCEDURE type of that"
		+ "corpus, spec/procedures.awawa with PATH, CITES and LAUNCHES, is a model the implementer"
		+ "reads once, as the rule distributed_tool_free_of_authors_machine of the instructions"
		+ "corpus requires"
		REF @DECISION.ShippedFilesLiveInsideThePackageAndAreReadAsResources
	SPEC "runs/<id>/role.md and the brief stay text, rendered from the entity, as"
		+ "@DECISION.EveryDocumentBrigadeReadsBackAcceptsAnAwawaFormAndTextIsARenderingHandedWhole"
		+ "sets: the client receives the same role and the same brief whichever form the file was"
		+ "in"
		REF @DECISION.EveryDocumentBrigadeReadsBackAcceptsAnAwawaFormAndTextIsARenderingHandedWhole
	SPEC "brigade roles list, show and lint and brigade run accept a role and a procedure in either"
		+ "form; roles lint names the file and the finding of awawa lint on an awawa role file;"
		+ "tests/unit prove a machine role, a ROLESET role and a procedure in the awawa form"
		+ "resolved and launched through a client double, and a role file off its schema refused"
		+ "naming the file; tests/cli gains at most one flow, brigade run launching a role in the"
		+ "awawa form through the fake client, as DESC 4 of the decision"
		+ "ThePortableContractIsTheCommandLineAndNeutralFiles sets"
	SPEC "the README's Roles and Runs sections state the two forms, the extension and the schema of"
		+ "each"
	RATIONALE "comfort, no quota gain: the body of a role and of a procedure is passed whole to the"
		+ "client in either form, brigade/runs/run_segment.py:65-66 for the role, so the awawa form"
		+ "saves no token; in @MILESTONE.ADD0 because the Markdown forms already work, @TASK.B43"
		+ "having delivered the role files and brigade run the procedures, and because the user"
		+ "wants brigade operational quickly, the improvements that are not indispensable"
		+ "deliverable by brigade itself"
		REF @MILESTONE.ADD0
		REF @TASK.B43
	RATIONALE "the path of an AGENT entity, brigade/roles/resolve_role.py:108-124, is the model:"
		+ "awawa --json fills the front matter from the fields and awawa context renders the body;"
		+ "the awawa form of a role file is that path on a file brigade reads itself, through the"
		+ "document kind rather than the corpus gateway alone"
	RATIONALE "after @TASK.B106, which introduces the document kind and its two built-in plugins;"
		+ "at the ratification, @DECISION.RolesAreSlotsBoundToRoleFiles, a role is a Markdown file,"
		+ "DESC 2 of @DECISION.ASlotIsBoundByTheSlotsTableOrByTheSlotItsRoleFileDeclares, a machine"
		+ "role file is any name ending in .md, and its REJECTED of a key repeated once per value,"
		+ "which the repeatable CAPABILITY of the awawa form reopens, are amended to the two forms"
		REF @TASK.B106
		REF @DECISION.RolesAreSlotsBoundToRoleFiles
		REF @DECISION.ASlotIsBoundByTheSlotsTableOrByTheSlotItsRoleFileDeclares
	SOURCE "the user's rulings of 2026-10-07: \"d'ailleurs: tout ce qui est un .md doit pouvoir"
		+ "être géré en utilisant awawa à la place, c'est à prévoir dans notre plan\"; on the plan"
		+ "of the decision, of this task and of the amendments: \"ok pour le plan ci-dessus\"; on"
		+ "the priorities: \"J'aimerais avoir une brigade opérationnelle rapidement, et"
