TASK B137
	TITLE "An invalid answer of the client adapter to launch-argv or parse-result ends the run on"
		+ "the outcome failed, with its run.finished and its result.json, instead of leaving it"
		+ "dead with no result"
	STATUS implemented
	MILESTONE @MILESTONE.F0
	COMPONENT "runs"
	ROLE ada
	SPEC "the BrigadeError read_client_answer raises on the launch-argv or the parse-result answer"
		+ "of a segment ends the segment and the run on the outcome failed: run.finished is"
		+ "appended with outcome failed, segments/<n>/result.json and runs/<id>/result.json are"
		+ "written with outcome failed and a message naming the adapter, the operation and the"
		+ "problem, as client adapter vibe answered launch-argv: lacks the key session_id, and"
		+ "brigade run exits 1, the code of failed; no further segment is launched"
		IMPL "brigade/runs/run_segment.py::record = _record_ending_before_launch(context.number,"
			+ "failure, None)"
		IMPL "brigade/runs/run_segment.py::return dataclasses.replace(record,"
			+ "exit_code=client_exit.exit_code, adapter_failure=str(error))"
		IMPL "brigade/runs/describe_finished.py::if record.adapter_failure is not None:"
		IMPL "tests/unit/runs/test_run_segment.py::def"
			+ "test_should_record_the_failure_of_the_adapter_apart_from_the_result_of_the_client(self):"
		IMPL "tests/unit/runs/test_describe_finished.py::def"
			+ "test_should_name_the_failure_of_the_adapter_and_keep_what_the_transcripts_measured(self):"
		IMPL "tests/unit/runs/test_describe_finished.py::def"
			+ "test_should_explain_the_nulls_of_a_client_answering_failed_itself_by_what_the_client_reported(self):"
		IMPL "tests/unit/runs/test_describe_finished.py::def"
			+ "test_should_name_the_failure_of_the_adapter_and_the_client_never_launched(self):"
		IMPL "brigade/runs/run_segment.py::ending = Ending(outcome=FAILED_OUTCOME,"
			+ "message=str(error))"
		IMPL "tests/unit/runs/test_run_segment.py::def"
			+ "test_should_end_the_segment_failed_naming_the_adapter_the_operation_and_the_problem(self):"
		IMPL "tests/unit/runs/test_run_segments.py::def"
			+ "test_should_keep_the_result_of_its_segment_as_the_result_of_the_run(self):"
		IMPL "tests/unit/runs/test_run_segment.py::def"
			+ "test_should_end_the_segment_failed_naming_the_adapter_the_operation_and_the_problem(self):"
		IMPL "tests/unit/runs/test_run_segment.py::def"
			+ "test_should_end_the_segment_failed_naming_the_adapter_the_operation_and_the_problem(self):"
		IMPL "tests/unit/runs/test_describe_finished.py::def"
			+ "test_should_name_the_failure_of_the_adapter_and_keep_what_the_transcripts_measured(self):"
	SPEC "the operations a segment asks the client are launch-argv,"
		+ "brigade/runs/run_segment.py:146, parse-result, :178, transcripts, :110, and actions,"
		+ "through the segment journal; a failure of transcripts or of actions is caught today,"
		+ "leaving the steps uncounted with their reason or the journal raw, and keeps that"
