TASK B163
	TITLE "Audit and remediation: no command of brigade in a shell line, the project's commands as"
		+ "argv steps, one sense per word, one command per thing, a README glossary with its guard,"
		+ "the dead fields removed"
	STATUS draft
	MILESTONE @MILESTONE.M8
	COMPONENT "audit"
	ROLE lex
	ROLE ada
	SPEC "no command brigade runs is interpreted by a shell and none is stored as a shell line:"
		+ "under brigade/, no sh -c, no shell=True and no && inside a value run as a command,"
		+ "brigade/adapters/schedulers/data/crontab-line.tpl included unless a DECISION rules its"
		+ "exception"
	SPEC "the commands of a project, PROJECT.SETUP, PROJECT.ACCEPTANCE and PROJECT.HEAVY, are steps"
		+ "of a recipe versioned by the project, each an argv array, run by the engine of"
		+ "@TASK.B51; no string field of brigade/corpus/data/schema.awawa.tpl holds a command, and"
		+ "brigade project add writes none"
	SPEC "no word of brigade carries two senses: for each word of the inventory in RATIONALE, one"
		+ "sense is kept and every other use is renamed in the code, the corpus, the README and the"
		+ "Blueprint, or the coexistence is ruled by a DECISION naming both senses"
	SPEC "no two commands of brigade do the same thing: the commands of one slot form one command"
		+ "group, and a command whose work another command does is removed or merged, verify and"
		+ "review among them"
	SPEC "README.md carries a glossary table between two marker comments, one row per word, the"
		+ "columns word, kind (command, argument, entity, field, concept), what it does and"
		+ "milestone, each row citing the task that delivers it"
	SPEC "a guard of tests/guards checks the glossary against the corpus, as"
		+ "tests/guards/test_readme_adapter_matrix.py checks the adapter matrix: it fails on a row"
		+ "citing a task the corpus lacks, on a milestone that is not that task's MILESTONE, on a"
		+ "command of brigade or an entity or field of the operational schema without a row, and on"
		+ "a row naming a word the code and the corpus do not carry"
	SPEC "PROJECT.GRAPH, POLICY.AUTO_RATIFY, POLICY.SAMPLING and PATTERN.EVIDENCE are removed from"
		+ "brigade/corpus/data/schema.awawa.tpl, each unless a task of the corpus reads it, that"
		+ "task named in the pull request"
	SPEC "what the audit does not settle becomes tasks of a remediation plan: one draft TASK per"
		+ "finding left, citing this task in its RATIONALE, the set listed in the pull request; the"
		+ "audit closes with no finding outside a SPEC of this task or a task of the plan"
	SPEC "wave, request and milestone keep the one sense TASK B187 gives each, a wave a batch of"
		+ "tasks started together, a request the user's text and its plan, a milestone a group of"
		+ "tasks toward one goal, in every command, argument, help line, procedure and message of"
