		+ "list of SPEC 3: wave, request and milestone (the ledger names a wave by its MILESTONE,"
		+ "brigade/waves/start_wave.py:34, the CLI by its REQUEST); slot (the nature of a judging"
		+ "step, the PROJECT.SLOTS cap, the [slots] binding of config.toml to an AGENT,"
		+ "STUDY.SLOT); step (a recipe step, an agent turn counted by budgets, the STEP entity of a"
		+ "progress file); check (brigade task check, a recipe gate check, the check runs of the"
